n, sans-serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;\">建设背景</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#5e85b0;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;\">  随着<span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\">我国</span>经济发展</span></span><span style=\"color:#5E85B0;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">模式从规模速度型向质量效率型转变，园区建设已成为区域协调发展的重要起点。目前，传统园区正面临“管理效率低、能源浪费大、综合安全薄弱、运营成本高”等问题。 成都古河云科技有限公司依托物联网、云平台、大数据等技术，通过整合园区三维场景、建</span></span><span style=\"color:#5E85B0;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;background-color:#FFFFFF;\"><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">筑BIM模型等时空信息，建设智能园区运维管理平台，完善园区全业务连接和数据集成，实现园区物联网、平台、可视化、可操作、高效运营、专业服务、智能发展。</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2023-12-25/202312251137132736.png\" title=\"西部产业园\" alt=\"西部产业园\" /><br /><br /><br /></p><p><br /></p><section style=\"margin:7px -16px 12px -17px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:0.544px;text-align:center;text-wrap:wrap;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:auto;background-color:#15559a;min-width:10%;height:auto;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 12px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:24px;color:#ffffff;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br /></p></section></section><p><strong><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenquanyi micro hei\", simsun, sans-serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#FFFFFF;\">建设目标</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#5e85b0;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, blinkmacsystemfont, \"helvetica neue\", \"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei ui\", \"microsoft yahei\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"color:#666666;font-family:\"lantinghei sc\", \"open sans\", arial, \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", stheiti, \"wenq